  m_text: '1.  Blow my skull (Whiskey glass): Beer, rum

    2.  Cuba libre (Whiskey
    glass): Ice, rum, cola

    3.  Daiquiri (Martini glass): Sugar, ice, rum, lime

    4. 
    Gimlet (Martini  glass): Gin, Lime juice, Lime

    5.  Kamikaze (C. Martini
    glass): Vodka, Triple Sec, lime juice, Shake, Lime

    6.  Margarita (Martini
    glass): Salt, ice, tequila, triple sec, lime juice, lime slice

    7.  Marquisette
    (Martini glass): Sugar, white wine, rum, lime juice, shake Lime slice

    8. 
    Mojito (Martini glass): Ice, rum, lime slice, mint

    9.  Moscow Mule (Copper
    Mug): Ice, vodka, ginger beer, lime slice

    10. Screwdriver (Whiskey glass):
    Ice, vodka, orange

    11. Shandygaff (Copper Mug): Beer, ginger beer

    12.
    Tequila slammer (Whiskey glass): Ice, tequila, ginger beer'
